{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15216200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15216200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521620001:0":{"text":"당신이 베르너인가요?","source_cn":"你是维尔纳？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE4E2CFFF6EF7D5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521620002:0":{"text":"누구시죠? 무슨 일로 절 찾아오셨나요?","source_cn":"你们是谁？找我有什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B94202889134ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521620003:0":{"text":"당신의 아버지가 남기신 편지를 찾았거든요. 아, 그리고 조각칼도요.","source_cn":"我们找到了你阿爹的信。唔，还有刻刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BEC850A5F611864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521620004:0":{"text":"조각칼이라고요?!\n말도 안 되는 소리하지 마세요! 아버지는 조각칼을 남에게 맡기실 분이 아니에요!","source_cn":"刻刀？！\\n怎么可能，我老爹不可能把他的刻刀交给任何人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2079C57AF25EFF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1521620004":{"text":"조각칼이라고요?!\n말도 안 되는 소리하지 마세요! 아버지는 조각칼을 남에게 맡기실 분이 아니에요!","source_cn":"刻刀？！\\n怎么可能，我老爹不可能把他的刻刀交给任何人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2079C57AF25EFF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521620005:0":{"text":"투타 마을이 멸망했다니... 거짓말하지 마세요!","source_cn":"图塔镇毁灭了……这、这不可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A36F580F2F5E92E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521620006:0":{"text":"그럼 아버지와 어머니는... 지금...","source_cn":"还有我老爹和老娘……他们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4AE0C8B5942610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521620007:0":{"text":"편지를 읽고 나면, 전부 이해하실 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"你看了信以后，就会明白的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA061CE06608686F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521620008:0":{"text":"떨리는 손으로 편지를 받아든 베르너는, 긴 침묵 후 눈가가 촉촉해졌다.","source_cn":"维尔纳颤抖地接过信。好半晌的沉默之后，他的眼里已盛满泪水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF549B48EA2E7114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521620009:0":{"text":"아버지는... 아버지는 어디에 계시나요? 아버지를 만나봐야겠어요...","source_cn":"我老爹……他，他在哪？我必须去找他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x770AA99817A5ED1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521620010:0":{"text":"이미 몬스터로 변하셨어요. 지금은 당신이 알고 계시는 그 아버지가 아니에요.","source_cn":"他已经畸变成怪物，不是你认识的那个人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4895B6397DB20F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521620011:0":{"text":"지금 어떤 모습을 하고 계셔도 좋아요! 제 아버지인걸요! 부탁이에요, 제발 절 데리고 가 주세요!","source_cn":"不管他变成什么样，他都是我老爹！求求你们，带我去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x598CE5871F24D33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521620012:0":{"text":"집에 몇 년째 못 돌아갔어요... 아버지께서는 항상 편지를 보내셨지만, 저는 늘 바빴거든요...","source_cn":"我已经好几年没有回去了……他总是写信，但我总是忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0634147F09B20C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521620013:0":{"text":"전... 아버지의 마지막 모습까지 놓치고 싶지 않아요...!","source_cn":"我……我不能连他最后一面也不见……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDC0367D16F292CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521620014:0":{"text":"하지만 지금의 투타 마을은 당신한테 너무 위험해요.","source_cn":"但是，图塔镇的黑暗对你来说太危险了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CDA4F194F8BF58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1521620014":{"text":"하지만 지금의 투타 마을은 당신한테 너무 위험해요.","sour